#### 🔴 HIGH — Assertion-Free Test (Unknown Test)

**Test:** `ProcessOrder_CompletesWithoutError` (line 43)  
**Evidence:** Calls `processor.ProcessOrder(order)` with zero assertions.  
**Risk:** Test always passes regardless of outcome — false confidence.

```csharp
// ❌ Current — no assertions
